## Command

```shell
biome format --write --javascript-formatter-expand=when-multiple --json-formatter-expand=when-multiple file.js file.json
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "formatter": { "expand": "never" } }
```

## `file.js`

```js
const single = { a: 1 };
const multiple = {
	a: 1,
	b: 2,
};
const array = [
	1,
	2,
];

```

## `file.json`

```json
{
	"single": { "a": 1 },
	"multiple": {
		"a": 1,
		"b": 2
	},
	"array": [
		1,
		2
	]
}

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Formatted 2 files in <TIME>. Fixed 2 files.
```
